  "Description": "Connected Autonomous Operation: the CAV as one Module (M3243). Human-CAV Interaction converses with the passenger and tells the Autonomous Motion Subsystem where to go; the Environment Sensing Subsystem describes the environment from the vehicle's sensors; the Autonomous Motion Subsystem plans the Route and the motion and tells HCI the Routes and their state; the Motion Actuation Subsystem moves the vehicle and answers the AMS. The Ego-Remote AMS and HCI Messages are its External Ports, exchanged with other CAVs.",
